{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044700/extras/78850c9b93c4425553e2945127824deb.avif?t=1758895820\" width=600 height=288 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ramona \u2013 Play With Me</strong> is a first-person psychological horror set in the 1970s: a haunting journey through light and darkness, truth and hallucination.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>exclusive demo</strong> invites you to experience <strong>a self-contained prequel</strong>, a separate story that captures the tension of the full game <strong>without revealing its main plot</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover key gameplay mechanics, dive into its claustrophobic atmosphere and taste the nightmare: short, intense and completely spoiler-free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A standalone experience worth playing even if you want to approach the full release with no story hints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044700/extras/b245be82428c73dceb8d58834754f090.avif?t=1758895820\" width=615 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tom</strong> is a small child who, along with many others, is cared for by Ramona, an elderly lady who hosts children in her home when their parents cannot be present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044700/extras/ef32f3db3687fb4b279cd0f6a94d1e28.avif?t=1758895820\" width=615 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044700/extras/c58084e9cc974622dc7cb97b23d7b2c7.webp?t=1758895820\" width=615 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything is as it seems. Little Tom will have to face his fears, escaping the torments that occur in <strong>that house</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044700/extras/5783120b4257f62a9b087ab1bfc726f6.avif?t=1758895820\" width=615 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the fear of darkness by lighting candles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044700/extras/e8eba267313230682dad832349f2ea7f.avif?t=1758895820\" width=615 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do what Ramona asks of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044700/extras/cda10251b6227053dbf6e39c25e7d223.avif?t=1758895820\" width=615 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles and help little Tom escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ramona - Play With Me is a short story that takes place before Ramona. Playing the demo won\u2019t spoil the full game\u2019s plot.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044700/extras/7f3881e7d4f707206e4f2883c9019232.webp?t=1758895820\" width=615 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Experience the horror from a child\u2019s point of view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Stay in the light to avoid dying of fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Environmental storytelling through letters, diaries, and photographs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Unique puzzles integrated into the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Original soundtrack inspired by the 1970s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tom wants to return to his parents. His fate is in your hands.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044700?t=1758895820","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044700/ddfe99900285548ee15f4ae46cfee500a2ef47bb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758895820","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044700/203595c62d7e644c0342eeab5ac999b26d93094b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758895820","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044700/203595c62d7e644c0342eeab5ac999b26d93094b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758895820","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044700/extras/78850c9b93c4425553e2945127824deb.avif?t=1758895820\" width=600 height=288 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ramona \u2013 Play With Me</strong> is a first-person psychological horror set in the 1970s: a haunting journey through light and darkness, truth and hallucination.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>exclusive demo</strong> invites you to experience <str