 by lighting candles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044700/extras/e8eba267313230682dad832349f2ea7f.avif?t=1758895820\" width=615 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do what Ramona asks of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044700/extras/cda10251b6227053dbf6e39c25e7d223.avif?t=1758895820\" width=615 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles and help little Tom escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ramona - Play With Me is a short story that takes place before Ramona. Playing the demo won\u2019t spoil the full game\u2019s plot.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044700/extras/7f3881e7d4f707206e4f2883c9019232.webp?t=1758895820\" width=615 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Experience the horror from a child\u2019s point of view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Stay in the light to avoid dying of fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Environmental storytelling through letters, diaries, and photographs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Unique puzzles integrated into the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Original soundtrack inspired by the 1970s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tom wants to return to his parents. His fate is in your hands.</i></p>","developers":["Daniele Doesn't Matter"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3863340","name":"Ramona"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":